      "blocks": [
        {
          "type": "header",
          "bbox": [
            0.626,
            0.047,
            0.847,
            0.064
          ],
          "content": "Large Numbers Around Us"
        },
        {
          "type": "paragraph_title",
          "bbox": [
            0.151,
            0.089,
            0.401,
            0.111
          ],
          "level": 2,
          "content": "Nearest Neighbours"
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "bbox": [
            0.15,
            0.12,
            0.848,
            0.177
          ],
          "content": "With large numbers it is useful to know the nearest thousand, lakh or crore. For example, the nearest neighbours of the number 6,72,85,183 are shown in the table below."
        },
        {
          "type": "table",
          "bbox": [
            0.24,
            0.181,
            0.759,
            0.333
          ],
          "content": "| Nearest thousand | 6,72,85,000 |\n| --- | --- |\n| Nearest ten thousand | 6,72,90,000 |\n| Nearest lakh | 6,73,00,000 |\n| Nearest ten lakh | 6,70,00,000 |\n| Nearest crore | 7,00,00,000 |",
          "captions": [],
          "footnotes": [],
          "image_source": "images/page_10_table_3.jpg"
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "bbox": [
            0.111,
            0.347,
            0.778,
            0.371
          ],
          "content": "? Similarly, write the five nearest neighbours for these numbers:"
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "bbox": [
            0.182,
            0.373,
            0.345,
            0.393
          ],
          "content": "(a) 3,87,69,957"
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "bbox": [
            0.183,
            0.397,
            0.353,
            0.417
          ],
          "content": "(b) 29,05,32,481"
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "bbox": [
            0.111,
            0.425,
            0.809,
            0.483
          ],
          "content": "I have a number for which all five nearest neighbours are 5,00,00,000. What could the number be? How many such numbers are there?"
        },
        {
          "type": "image",
          "bbox": [
            0.818,
            0.42,
            0.905,
            0.478
          ],
          "content": "",
          "captions": [],
          "footnotes": [],
          "image_source": "images/page_10_image_8.jpg"
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "bbox": [
            0.151,
            0.493,
            0.78,
            0.514
          ],
          "content": "Roxie and Estu are estimating the values of simple expressions."
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "bbox": [
            0.152,
            0.518,
            0.383,
            0.538
          ],
          "content": "1. 4,63,128 + 4,19,682,"
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "bbox": [
            0.174,
            0.542,
            0.772,
            0.58
          ],
          "content": "Roxie: “The sum is near 8,00,000 and is more than 8,00,000.” Estu: “The sum is near 9,00,000 and is less than 9,00,000.”"
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "bbox": [
            0.206,
            0.585,
            0.847,
            0.622
          ],
          "content": "(a) Are these estimates correct? Whose estimate is closer to the sum?"
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "bbox": [
            0.206,
            0.626,
            0.847,
            0.665
          ],
          "content": "(b) Will the sum be greater than 8,50,000 or less than 8,50,000? Why do you think so?"
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "bbox": [
            0.207,
            0.669,
            0.846,
            0.708
          ],
          "content": "(c) Will the sum be greater than 8,83,128 or less than 8,83,128? Why do you think so?"
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "bbox": [
            0.208,
            0.712,
            0.713,
            0.732
          ],
          "content": "(d) Exact value of 4,63,128 + 4,19,682 ="
        },
        {
          "type": "paragraph_title",
          "bbox": [
            0.152,
            0.736,
            0.389,
            0.755
          ],
          "level": 2,
          "content": "2. 14,63,128 – 4,90,020"
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "bbox": [
            0.174,
            0.76,
            0.837,
            0.799
          ],
          "content": "Roxie: “The difference is near 10,00,000 and is less than 10,00,000.” Estu: “The difference is near 9,00,000 and is more than 9,00,000.”"
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "bbox": [
            0.206,
            0.802,
            0.847,
            0.841
          ],
          "content": "(a) Are these estimates correct? Whose estimate is closer to the difference?"
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "bbox": [
            0.207,
            0.845,
            0.847,
            0.884
          ],
          "content": "(b) Will the difference be greater than 9,50,000 or less than 9,50,000? Why do you think so?"
        },
        {
          "type": "page_number",
          "bbox": [
            0.812,
            0.938,
